{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It is recommended to connect the controller before launching the game.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/f4e024e2427dd6266268f288042f7a16.avif?t=1765766839\" width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a 3D side-scrolling adventure where fierce anthropomorphic animal warriors battle through breathtaking worlds in fast-paced, action-packed combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.poster.avif?t=1765766839\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.webm?t=1765766839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.mp4?t=1765766839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a non-plot, purely fun game with many levels, each with a BOSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the BOSS to enter the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.poster.avif?t=1765766839\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.webm?t=1765766839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.mp4?t=1765766839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are in side-scrolling combat mode: move left, move right, jump, punch attack, kick attack, dodge, wall jump, and special move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.poster.avif?t=1765766839\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.webm?t=1765766839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.mp4?t=1765766839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ape level has nothing to do with racism. They are strong and cool, &quot;We are not monkeys&quot;, meaning we are strong apes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615920?t=1765766839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/86661aa71a3f0dd29b40fad369969fe574c45885/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765766839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/ab79d041eb7a7af423d3070678de615ead6dd212/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765766839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/ab79d041eb7a7af423d3070678de615ead6dd212/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765766839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"control